ri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z0yuu8Jgup4Q7kNvwFJ-xvI&_nc_oc=AdqOggSZBifTfuJUq1gA2rGMHSHoH1ZYFoL-guhSRgMwQ0KYFJvjMIboAHLpri2vLAs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGdbUXkKZDLZgYqnd9dGzm9rirGHxtG4gbiWaf5obmdnA&oe=6A75CC64"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YXMx0u6P8gAQ7kNvwGyTBzz&_nc_oc=Ado8TgvOUbb1Ct1NUJDRdUu4ny2iaP_tUvtU-MDQmCwDinK3CgglcmYE5oLee-xZeoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEj036p1Jt2gqS4unF_AdTuzTR4a6fG0YGIjpOfmRE5fw&oe=6A75DFD7"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w009kxmqL4MQ7kNvwEuh_Cm&_nc_oc=AdozN6Q59YGtDow5Y6S6MkdEwCv_t6m2VmtjrLtRJd6-Di8hta0dXDUUFYLQ_f5FLxk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGh_LNMM3TMZo8oGao9zWm3LyQKaY6dHJaZf_FQkFmQpw&oe=6A75F6E2"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-feho6MSd1IQ7kNvwEYHAzC&_nc_oc=Adqc2tt7omGWpIFm5dfH8JnOLRNkJkG1XJ3KGlAtznbyLVy0MQsDZP2bKMTxiT63KpI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFleXG88f-f55iu8LxJwLFPUtyMdyQbcfhDBnBpVE52ug&oe=6A75F1DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_LakeHouse_2560x1440.png", "id": "1547163436915760", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825305_1547163440249093_3018434286459742065_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oXQGmhzXyW8Q7kNvwH2DQJM&_nc_oc=AdrwQTCs7zlKVqi_1t1O3r_OAtk-ZVhvUqtAyj8hnaQHSaGREadC7HXn_jx7ZaehP9I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG1WQlLDx157OUHQ6D2FpxVA01P27-f5NpTUnHP2ETuvA&oe=6A75D579"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort